<p>jab zaaeraan-e- shaah ghareebul watan phire<br />
yaani sooe watan haram-e- panjetan phire<br />
ek daste tohfa leke nishaane haram phire<br />
ghul tha ke ahle baite hussain aur hassan phire</p>

<p>sattar do tan ko zere zamee'n sompe aaye hai<br />
kuch surre qaake paak ke hamraah laaye hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah guzaar qaafele ka shaher me huwa<br />
aur lashkar-e- basheer me naqqaara bhi bajaa<br />
awaaz tez gaami-e- aspa'n huwi bapaa<br />
hamsaaiyo'n ko fatima sughra ne di sadaa</p>

<p>logo sawaari aati hai kis baadshaah ki<br />
sab ne kahaa ke sibt-e- risaalat panaah ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>itne me umme haaniya us dam falak weqaar<br />
sar par qazaa ba paau'n me mouze bhi aashkaar<br />
ummul banee'n ke saath wahaa'n aayi ek baar<br />
sughra se poocha ab to na hoga tumhe buqaar</p>

<p>ghul hai ke zainab aati hai shabbir aate hai<br />
chalti ho tum bhi hum to unhe lene jaate hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo boli peshwayi ko moujood hu magar<br />
hai qasd chup rahu kisi goshe me baith kar<br />
akbar talaash me phire aawaaz de pidar<br />
asghar bhi ghutniyo'n mujhe dhoonde idhar udhar</p>

<p>jab sab kahe ke margayi chut-te hi aap se<br />
hansti huwi mai aake lipat jaau baap se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ek martaba saro'n pe pade mard-o- zan ke haath<br />
jaana sabho'n ne qatl huwe shaah-e- nek zaat<br />
sughra ne poocha daadi ye kaisi hai waaredaat<br />
ye fouj to gayi thi na mere pidar ke saath</p>

<p>hai hai musaaferou pa mere kya guzar gayi<br />
poocho to unse fouj-e- hussaini kidhar gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaqir na reh saki sooe lashkar ye di sadaa<br />
tum karbala me taaza mulaazim huwe ho kya<br />
akbar ke paaye naam hai tum logou ka paraa<br />
baare kaho gurohe hussaini kahaa rahaa</p>

<p>batlaao momino mai hu pyaari hussain ki<br />
ab kitni door hogi sawaari hussain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah aaya syedo'n ka ghoul nange sar<br />
daamaan-e- sabz kurto'n ke the chaak sar basar<br />
aage alam liye huwe ek tifle be pidar<br />
maatam ke neel chaand se seene pe jalwagar</p>

<p>mashkeeza-e- sakina alam me bandha huwa<br />
ek teer usme behre gawaahi laga huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zer-e- nishaan padhte the nouha har ek qadam<br />
maatam hussain pyaase ka karte the dam badam<br />
gham se larazne lagta tha jab panja-e-alam<br />
badhte the aage saahebe maatam ba chashme nam</p>

<p>faaregh jo maatame shah-e- waala se hote the<br />
phir kehke haaye hazrate abbas rote the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ummul banee'n ne naam jo abbas ka suna<br />
aankho'n se noor seene se dil hogaya juda<br />
sughra ko umme salma ki aaghosh me diya<br />
boli mai badh ke poochu to ye maajra hai kya</p>

<p>aghlab hai unse sibt-e- nabi ki qabar mile<br />
kis ke yateem aate hai paa nange sar khule<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke chand gaam badhi wo basad bukaa<br />
kaandhe pe jis yateem ke tha wo alam dharaa<br />
hairat se us ghareeb ka mu dekha khoob saa<br />
beenaayi jaa chuki thi na pehchaana mutlaqaa</p>

<p>poocha ke ye nishaan tujhe kab ataa huwa<br />
aye haamil-e- alam mera abbas kya huwa<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>